Error [jet.UnknownName]: Nothing named `it` exists here
  --> tests/ui/E0107_it_outside_a_loop.jet:4:11
    |
  4 |     print(it)
    |           ^^
 Why: A name must be declared before it's used
 Fix: `it` is the item only inside a bindingless loop such as `loop items -> it * 2`; elsewhere name the item: `loop item in items { ... }`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0107
